# LF-only tree (B3 R6): the bench ships bash/python/yaml that EXECUTE on
# the Pi — a CRLF smudge (e.g. a Windows clone under core.autocrlf=true)
# breaks bench.sh at the shebang. eol=lf overrides core.autocrlf per-repo,
# in BOTH directions (checkout and add), which is the whole ratchet.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
